--- !u!114 &8476464549284738388
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4934218994079438117}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 397714dcc8548bb45b9086b5ac915a16, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _text: {fileID: 6242610091052820764}
  _image: {fileID: 2154675575377805756}
  _informationList:
  - Prepare before the enemies arrive, find a suitable spot to build your base.
  - Invest in lumberyards to generate wood required for building defences. You can
    build them only in certain spots. Defend them well.
  - Use the build menu to create your defences. You can use keybinds on the icons
    to quickly select them.
  - Enemies will spawn on the edge of the map, be careful when being there. You can
    place buildings on the edge to block enemy spawns.
  - If you have issues with building look at the notification in the bottom right,
    it will tell you the reason.
  - Press 'Space' or 'T' to use your crossbow. Just point where you want to shoot.
  - Press 'R' next to damaged buildings to repair them. It will cost you a small
    amount of resources.
  - Press 'E' to activate the tactical view, it will allow you to see more of the
    battlefield.
  - Press 'Esc' in game to pause and display keybinds.
  _imageList:
  - {fileID: 0}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8c16f55d1af8074683603add2852ad2, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: d6ecb6536a1df45468cde165f0c56b03, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 0}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09e5c290ab5d5ce488e7155eeeaa2d11, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 809ea1d481f2a264f8a82d465fc1bff4, type: 3}
